---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout title="About Us">
  <div class="page-header">
    <h1>Our Legacy & Milestones</h1>
  </div>

  <section class="content-section">
    <div class="grid">
      <div class="floating-card">
        <h3>1994: The Pioneer Era</h3>
        <p>Founded by D. Ramprakash as Ramanathapuram's first computer educational institution teaching both software and hardware.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="floating-card">
        <h3>1998: Bringing the Internet</h3>
        <p>First institution to establish internet connectivity via STD and conduct district-wide awareness seminars.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="floating-card">
        <h3>2004: Sarva Shiksha Abhiyan</h3>
        <p>Successfully imparted computer education to over 2,000 rural students across the Bogalur educational block.</p>
      </div>
      <div class="floating-card">
        <h3>E-Governance Projects</h3>
        <p>Executed MNIC pilot data entries, Election Photo Identity Card (EPIC) outsourcing, and inclusive employment for physically challenged operators.</p>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <style>
    .page-header { background: var(--dark-bg); color: white; padding: 4rem 2rem; text-align: center; }
    .content-section { padding: 4rem 5%; max-width: 1200px; margin: 0 auto; }
    .grid { display: grid; grid-template-columns: repeat(auto-fit, minmax(400px, 1fr)); gap: 2rem; }
    h3 { color: var(--primary); margin-bottom: 1rem; }
  </style>
</Layout>